{
  "_comment": "Serial experiment queue for the 4 GB single-GPU box. Stages MUST NOT run concurrently: one Ollama model is resident and two protocol-2 runs contend for VRAM and time out. Queue 001: finish the exp009 temperature sweep, then run the v10b calibration gate, then STOP for the freeze-rule decision. v10b main and v10a main are deliberately NOT in this manifest - v10b main requires the calibration freeze rule to be applied with real numbers first, and v10a is 2.5 h so it should be an explicit choice.",
